# Ignore Python ML Service from Vercel serverless builds
# The ML service is a standalone FastAPI service with 300MB+ C-libraries (xgboost, scipy, llvmlite)
# which exceeds Vercel's 250MB serverless limit. The Node.js API uses its built-in engine.
ml-service/
data/
docs/
backend/node_modules/
*.log
.git
.github
